<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 576.72, up 1.09.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 283 to 236.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 24,275,200 compared with 22,093,330 Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
